{
  "id": "poem-041",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">感谢生老病死，让河流得以顺畅，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">在苦难中坚守，在乐中怡情。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">感谢低地与高山，给河流有了起伏。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">感谢无常，生成河流两岸的四季。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">感谢成败，河流有了波澜。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">哎玛吙，我们终会汇入海洋，彼此相融，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我们会再一次蒸腾，共赴明日，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">共赴人世间的剧场，剧中的人们阿，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">你可以哭泣，但不要持续地悲伤，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">因为你是剧中人。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">感谢死神，感谢他如此耐心。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/041.webp\" data-caption=\"《生命》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《生命》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/041.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《生命》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《生命》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 41 页</p>"
}
